   [
    "Only when the enclosing function is about to return does `try` test for an error returned by `f`."
   ],
   [
    "Without changes to the behavior of `try`, such an error might then overwrite another error currently being returned by the enclosing function."
   ],
   [
    "This is at best confusing, and at worst error-prone."
   ],
   [
    "Therefore we suggest to disallow `try` as the called function in a `defer` statement as well."
   ],
   [
    "We can always revisit this decision if sensible applications are found."
   ]
  ]
 },
